#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0282A expect=skipped domain=ADAE
#note "ASEV itself is NOT declared - the dataset carries the SDTM-side AESEV instead. Requirements.Variables.All [ASEV] gates the rule to SKIPPED. This is the auditable form of the EC-43 'absent is not empty' ruling for a Permissible variable: ASEV was never planned, and the rule must not report it as blank. The All gate also means the fixture never reaches BroadcastFold's absent-column empty() fold."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AEDECOD type=Char
col AESEV   type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | MILD
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | NAUSEA | MODERATE
